# local instructions and generated or session data
CLAUDE.local.md
node_modules/
_site/
# Boards are working files and stay local, except the ones the project shows:
# the design review (kept whole: source, log and page, so the repo opens as a
# working board), the roadmap, and the sample in two languages. For those
# three the page is built by `cards render`; the source and the log are kept.
.cards/*
!.cards/design-review/
!.cards/roadmap/
!.cards/demo/
!.cards/demo-zh/
.cards/roadmap/board.html
.cards/demo/board.html
.cards/demo-zh/board.html
.cards/*/shot.png
